        },
        {
          "word": " special.",
          "start": 1317.39,
          "end": 1317.94,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "This grayish material is very reflective. And this is what Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin said when they landed on the moon.",
