          "speaker": "Apamea"
        },
        {
          "word": " know.",
          "start": 2609.31,
          "end": 2609.79,
          "speaker": "Apamea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And I, I've taken a whole thing of penicillin or whatever. And it's still staying in my nose. And it's driving me wild, you know. I,",
