          "speaker": "Apamea"
        },
        {
          "word": " problem.",
          "start": 2619.21,
          "end": 2619.96,
          "speaker": "Apamea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And as I let go of thinking so much about that particular problem, which is with my education.",
