          "speaker": "Apamea"
        },
        {
          "word": " education.",
          "start": 2624.51,
          "end": 2624.86,
          "speaker": "Apamea"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Some problems happened with the committee and this and that. And I was so preoccupied with it. And I would cry about it.",
      "start": 2625.47,
      "end": 2631.37,
      "speaker": "Apamea",
      "words": [
