          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Quran was not in the format that God intended for the world. It was written in the chronological sequence.",
      "start": 3576.87,
      "end": 3581.49,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " The",
          "start": 3576.87,
